                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The United Nations Security Council met on August 2 from 3 to 6:15 p. m.; for the
                    record, see U.N. document S/PV.481. No action was taken during the meeting,
                    which dealt mainly with Korea, as the Council was deadlocked on the procedural
                    question of the adoption of an agenda.</p>
            </div>
